<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce sheds more than 5 pct after Q1 results.</title>
<headline>Oce sheds more than 5 pct after Q1 results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten dived by more than five percent by Wednesday midsession following the release of first quarter results late on Tuesday.</p>
<p>At 1205 GMT, its shares were down 13.30 guilders to 226.00.</p>
<p>Traders said that though the 62 percent rise in first quarter profit was in line with expectations, the jump had come with little organic growth.</p>
<p>&quot;They just seem to have gained from currency effects and acquisitions,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
